{"id":"4bd6738f7a0d310b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-analytic-completeness.md","title":"Souslin's Theorem","display":"thm-analytic-completeness — Souslin's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-analytic-completeness","aliases":["58-thm-analytic-completeness","Analytic Completeness","Σ^1_1 Completeness","Souslin Theorem"],"display":"thm-analytic-completeness — Souslin's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","[[../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-analytic-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-analytic-completeness</span><span>Analytic Completeness</span><span>Σ^1_1 Completeness</span><span>Souslin Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytic-completeness — Souslin's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc6b982512ea7cbd\" href=\"?note=bc6b982512ea7cbd\" title=\"../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md\">../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-analytic-completeness-—-Analytic-Completeness\">thm-analytic-completeness — Analytic Completeness</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\((\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (the real line with its standard Polish topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}\\)</span> (analytic-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc6b982512ea7cbd\" href=\"?note=bc6b982512ea7cbd\" title=\"../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md\">../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complement clause is the typed meaning of co-analytic; this assertion is Souslin's theorem, not a generic completeness claim.</li>\n<li>Universal analytic set: there exists <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^2\">\\(U \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> such that every analytic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\\)</span> is some section <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_x\">\\(U_x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Well-founded trees give a standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>-complete example.</li>\n<li>Disjoint analytic sets admit Borel separation.</li>\n<li>Universal-set and completeness results mentioned below are consequences or related theorems, not extra conjuncts of the main assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-analytic-completeness-—-Analytic-Completeness","text":"thm-analytic-completeness — Analytic Completeness","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc6b982512ea7cbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc6b982512ea7cbd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}$ (analytic-set predicate, see [[../batch14/58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^2","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"U_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4025","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-analytic-completeness.md|58-thm-analytic-completeness]]（batch11）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]